- Gate compatibility (class/region) respected.
- No overlapping robust intervals on same gate; turnaround buffers respected.
- Adjacent conflict and MARS rules respected.
- Rotations: same gate, min turn satisfied.
- Apron occupancy <= 3 at all event times; remote bank limits respected.
- Handler capacities (total/wide-body) per bank respected.
- Security/immigration/remote-bus capacities respected.
- Taxiway metering respected.
- Critical connections within max walk; noncritical excess recorded.
- Output schema: `flight_id,assignment_type,gate_id`, apron rows have blank gate_id.

